    "title": "Police seek suspects in Walmart larceny in Oneida - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n10 hours ago ONEIDA, NY — Police are asking for the public’s help identifying three people suspected of stealing merchandise from Walmart. The larceny occurred on Sept. 12 at approximately 7:40 p.m. Three suspects, two males and one female, reportedly left the store with approximately $216.13 in merchandise without paying, according... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
